{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はほぼ5thの選抜メンバーで\n収録がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとはプリンシパルのレッスン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々充実させてもらってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がもったいなくて\n睡眠時間すらもったいなくて\n無意味におきてる自分くあしく。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ寝てないわけじゃないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ちゃんと体調管理しなきゃ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ちゃんと寝なきゃだめだよ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってみなさんは言うんだろうな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの愛は伝わってます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/15/3589288/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか別の類の言葉も見てみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/04/15/3589288/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んまあ\nいわゆるムチャブリってやつですか(￣∇￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で言ったものの\n例えばどんなのだろうか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え、なにこのムチャブリ(゜ロ゜)\n過酷すぎわろたんご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり睡眠時間については\nふれなくて大丈夫です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin6